ass=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\" href=\"/login\">Login</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"container-koro border-t border-border py-5 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Korot. Built to discover, learn, and preserve language knowledge.</div></footer><nav aria-label=\"Primary\" class=\"fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-30 grid grid-cols-6 border-t border-border bg-card/95 pb-[env(safe-area-inset-bottom)] backdrop-blur-md md:hidden\"><a class=\"flex min-h-14 select-none flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors active:bg-muted text-muted-foreground\" href=\"/\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-house size-5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8\"></path><path d=\"M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-6a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 6A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z\"></path></svg>Home</a><a class=\"flex min-h-14 select-none flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors active:bg-muted text-muted-foreground\" href=\"/languages\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-languages size-5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m5 8 6 6\"></path><path d=\"m4 14 6-6 2-3\"></path><path d=\"M2 5h12\"></path><path d=\"M7 2h1\"></path><path d=\"m22 22-5-10-5 10\"></path><path d=\"M14 18h6\"></path></svg>Languages</a><a class=\"flex min-h-14 select-none flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors active:bg-muted text-muted-foreground\" href=\"/dictionary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open size-5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"></path><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"></path></svg>Dictionary</a><a class=\"flex min-h-14 select-none flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors active:bg-muted text-muted-foreground\" href=\"/search\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search size-5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg>Search</a><a class=\"flex min-h-14 select-none flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-medium transition-colors active:bg-muted text-muted-foreground\" href=\"/login\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-user size-5 transition-transform\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H9a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg>Login</a><button aria-label=\"More menu\" class=\"flex min-h-14 select-none flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground transition-colors active:bg-muted\" type=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg>More</button></nav></div><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Notifications (F8)\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"pointer-events:none\"><ol tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"fixed bottom-0 right-0 z-[100] flex w-full max-w-sm flex-col gap-2 p-4 outline-none sm:bottom-4 sm:right-4\"></ol></div><script>requestAnimationFrame(function(){$RT=performance.now()});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-c2c88ec01ff0ef03.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><div hidden id=\"S:0\"><div><section class=\"border-b border-border bg-muted/30\"><div class=\"container-koro grid gap-8 py-10 sm:gap-10 sm:py-20 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] lg:items-center lg:gap-20\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">About Korot</p><h1 class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-5xl\">A home for words.<br class=\"hidden sm:block\"/> <!-- -->A connection to culture.</h1><p class=\"mt-5 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 sm:mt-6 text-muted-foreground\">Korot helps people discover, learn, and preserve language knowledge. We bring words, meanings, and translations together, with a focus on indigenous languages and the communities that keep them alive.</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:mt-8 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full text-sm font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary-hover shadow-sm h-11 px-5 min-h-12 w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"/dictionary\">Explore Dictionary <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full text-sm font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer border border-border bg-transparent hover:bg-muted h-11 px-5 min-h-12 w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"/languages\">Browse Languages</a></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 sm:rounded-3xl sm:p-8\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-earth size-8 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.54 15H17a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4.54\"></path><path d=\"M7 3.34V5a3 3 0 0 0 3 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2c0 1.1.9 2 2 2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h3.17\"></path><path d=\"M11 21.95V18a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2.05\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg><h2 class=\"mt-6 text-xl font-semibold\">More than a word and its meaning</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground\">A language connects people to family, place, and tradition. Making that knowledge easier to find gives more people a way to learn, share, and stay connected to it.</p><div class=\"mt-6 border-t border-border pt-5\"><p class=\"text-sm font-medium\">Open to explore. Built with community.</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Start with a familiar word. Discover where it takes you.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container-koro py-10 sm:py-20\" aria-labelledby=\"values-heading\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">Our purpose</p><h2 id=\"values-heading\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Language knowledge belongs within reach.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-7 text-muted-foreground\">We want to make it easier to discover a language, learn from its speakers, and help preserve the knowledge they share. These principles guide Korot.</p><div class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:mt-8 sm:gap-5 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 sm:p-6\"><div class=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-muted text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-earth size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21.54 15H17a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4.54\"></path><path d=\"M7 3.34V5a3 3 0 0 0 3 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2c0 1.1.9 2 2 2a2 2 0 0 0 2-2c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h3.17\"></path><path d=\"M11 21.95V18a2 2 0 0 0-2-2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-1a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H2.05\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-semibold\">Every language matters</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground\">Languages carry stories, identity, and everyday knowledge. Korot makes space for languages and communities that are often underrepresented online.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 sm:p-6\"><div class=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-muted text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-semibold\">Knowledge grows together</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground\">Speakers and learners bring different perspectives. By suggesting translations, the community helps make language knowledge more useful and accessible.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 sm:p-6\"><div class=\"flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-muted text-primary\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check size-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-semibold\">Care in every contribution</h3><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground\">Suggested translations go through review. Pending contributions are kept distinct from reviewed entries, so learners can understand what they are reading.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-border bg-muted/40 py-10 sm:py-20\" aria-labelledby=\"steps-heading\"><div class=\"container-koro\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">Getting started</p><h2 id=\"steps-heading\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Follow your curiosity.</h2><ol class=\"mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:mt-8 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-10\"><li class=\"flex flex-col border-t border-border pt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-compass size-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground\">0<!-- -->1</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-lg font-semibold\">Explore</h3><p class=\"mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground\">Browse languages and dictionary categories, or search for a word. You can start without an account.</p><a class=\"mt-3 inline-flex min-h-12 sm:mt-5 items-center gap-2 self-start rounded-sm text-sm font-semibold underline-offset-4 hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring\" href=\"/languages\">Browse languages<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li class=\"flex flex-col border-t border-border pt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open-text size-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 5v16\"></path><path d=\"M16 13h2\"></path><path d=\"M16 9h2\"></path><path d=\"M20.001 19A2 2 0 0022 17V5a2 2 0 00-1.999-2L16 3.002A5 5 0 0012 5a5 5 0 00-4-2H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 001.999 2H8a5 5 0 014 2 5 5 0 014-2z\"></path><path d=\"M6 13h2\"></path><path d=\"M6 9h2\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground\">0<!-- -->2</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-lg font-semibold\">Learn</h3><p class=\"mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground\">Discover meanings and translations, with pronunciation and examples where available.</p><a class=\"mt-3 inline-flex min-h-12 sm:mt-5 items-center gap-2 self-start rounded-sm text-sm font-semibold underline-offset-4 hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring\" href=\"/dictionary\">Explore the dictionary<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li class=\"flex flex-col border-t border-border pt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bookmark-plus size-6 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v6\"></path><path d=\"M15 10H9\"></path><path d=\"M17 3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v15a1 1 0 0 1-1.496.868l-4.512-2.578a2 2 0 0 0-1.984 0l-4.512 2.578A1 1 0 0 1 5 20V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground\">0<!-- -->3</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 text-lg font-semibold\">Make it yours</h3><p class=\"mt-2 flex-1 text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground\">Create an account to save words in personal books and return to what you want to learn.</p><a class=\"mt-3 inline-flex min-h-12 sm:mt-5 items-center gap-2 self-start rounded-sm text-sm font-semibold underline-offset-4 hover:underline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-ring\" href=\"/register\">Create an account<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li></ol></div></section><section class=\"container-koro py-10 sm:py-20\" aria-labelledby=\"community-heading\"><div class=\"grid gap-6 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 sm:gap-8 sm:rounded-3xl sm:p-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] lg:items-center lg:gap-16\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-muted-foreground\">The community</p><h2 id=\"community-heading\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Your knowledge can help someone learn.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-muted-foreground\">Know a translation? Want to reconnect with a language or discover a new one? There is a place for you here. Explore the dictionary, build your own books, or suggest translations for review.</p></div><div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col items-start gap-4 border-t border-border pt-6 lg:border-l lg:border-t-0 lg:pl-10 lg:pt-0\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Start with one word.</h3><p class=\"text-sm leading-7 text-muted-foreground\">Browsing is open to everyone. Create an account when you are ready to save words or contribute.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full text-sm font-semibold transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-background disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 cursor-pointer bg-primary text-primary-foreground hover:bg-primary-hover shadow-sm h-11 px-5 min-h-12 w-full sm:w-auto\" href=\"/register\">Join Korot <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox